<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>통합 엑셀 관리</title>
  <style>
    body .container.excel-page { width: calc(100% - 32px); max-width: 1080px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-bottom: 70px; }
    .excel-title { font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 650; color: #1e3a5f; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
    .excel-intro { color: #64748b; font-size: .85rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .excel-tabs { display: flex; gap: .4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; border-bottom: 1px solid #dce4ee; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .excel-tabs .nav-link { border: 0; border-radius: 7px 7px 0 0; color: #475569; font-size: .87rem; padding: .7rem 1rem; }
    .excel-tabs .nav-link.active { color: #175ac4; background: #eaf2ff; font-weight: 650; }
    .excel-panel { border: 1px solid #e0e7ef; border-radius: 10px; background: #fff; overflow: hidden; }
    .excel-panel-head { padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e9eef5; }
    .excel-panel-head h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 650; margin: 0 0 .2rem; }
    .excel-panel-head p { color: #64748b; font-size: .79rem; margin: 0; }
    .excel-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; justify-content: space-between; padding: .9rem 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1f6; }
    .excel-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .excel-row-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: .88rem; }
    .excel-row-detail { display: block; color: #64748b; font-size: .76rem; margin-top: .2rem; }
    .excel-row .btn { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: .8rem; white-space: nowrap; }
    .excel-month { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
    .excel-month .form-control { width: 160px; font-size: .83rem; }
    .excel-callout { background: #f1f6ff; border: 1px solid #d8e6fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: .8rem 1rem; color: #365678; font-size: .79rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    @media (max-width: 620px) { .excel-row { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } .excel-month { flex-wrap: wrap; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('header') %>
  <main class="container excel-page mt-4">
    <h1 class="excel-title">통합 엑셀 관리</h1>
    <p class="excel-intro">입력 양식 다운로드, 데이터 일괄 처리와 보고서 내보내기를 한곳에서 관리합니다.</p>

    <div class="nav nav-tabs excel-tabs" id="excelTabs" role="tablist" aria-label="엑셀 작업 구분">
      <button class="nav-link active" id="templates-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#templates" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="templates" aria-selected="true">입력 양식</button>
      <button class="nav-link" id="security-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#security" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="security" aria-selected="false">보안업무 양식</button>
      <button class="nav-link" id="data-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#data" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="data" aria-selected="false">데이터 처리</button>
      <button class="nav-link" id="reports-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#reports" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="reports" aria-selected="false">보고서</button>
    </div>

    <div class="tab-content">
      <section class="tab-pane fade show active" id="templates" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="templates-tab">
        <div class="excel-callout">입력 양식은 데이터를 등록할 때 사용하는 파일입니다. 양식을 내려받아 작성한 후 해당 업무의 가져오기 기능을 이용하세요.</div>
        <div class="excel-panel">
          <div class="excel-panel-head"><h2>입력 양식 다운로드</h2><p>현재 시스템에서 제공하는 엑셀 입력 형식입니다.</p></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">직원정보 입력 양식</span><span class="excel-row-detail">직원 일괄 등록용</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/employees/excel/template">양식 다운로드</a></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">근무 스케줄 입력 양식</span><span class="excel-row-detail">근무 스케줄 작성 참고용</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/workSchedule/excel/template">양식 다운로드</a></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">유니폼 입력 양식</span><span class="excel-row-detail">유니폼 정보 작성 참고용</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/uniform/excel/template">양식 다운로드</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tab-pane fade" id="security" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="security-tab">
        <div class="excel-callout">양식 등록·교체는 이곳에서, 양식 사용과 다운로드는 각 보안업무 화면에서도 할 수 있습니다.</div>
        <div class="excel-panel mb-3">
          <div class="excel-panel-head"><h2>근무명령서 엑셀 양식</h2><p>현재 양식을 교체합니다. .xlsx 파일, 최대 2MB.</p></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title" id="workOrderTemplateName">양식 정보를 불러오는 중입니다.</span><span class="excel-row-detail" id="workOrderTemplateDate"></span></div><div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm d-none" id="workOrderTemplateDownload" href="/work-orders/template/download">다운로드</a><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-template-kind="work-order" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#securityTemplateModal">업로드·교체</button></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="excel-panel mb-3">
          <div class="excel-panel-head d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2"><div><h2>보안업무 공통 양식</h2><p>근무명령 작성 화면에서 선택해 사용하는 엑셀 양식입니다.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-template-kind="general" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#securityTemplateModal">양식 등록</button></div>
          <div id="securityGeneralTemplates" aria-live="polite"><div class="excel-row text-muted small">목록을 불러오는 중입니다.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="excel-panel">
          <div class="excel-panel-head d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2"><div><h2>요약보고서 양식</h2><p>보고서 작성 화면에서 사용하는 엑셀 양식입니다.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-template-kind="summary" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#securityTemplateModal">양식 등록</button></div>
          <div id="securitySummaryTemplates" aria-live="polite"><div class="excel-row text-muted small">목록을 불러오는 중입니다.</div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tab-pane fade" id="data" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="data-tab">
        <div class="excel-callout">데이터 가져오기는 시스템의 직원 기록을 변경합니다. 업로드 전 입력 양식과 파일 내용을 확인하세요.</div>
        <div class="excel-panel">
          <div class="excel-panel-head"><h2>데이터 가져오기 · 내보내기</h2><p>실제 시스템 데이터를 파일로 내보내거나 일괄 등록합니다.</p></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">직원정보</span><span class="excel-row-detail">전체 직원 목록 다운로드 또는 엑셀·CSV 일괄 등록</span></div><div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/employees/excel?format=xlsx">내보내기</a><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#employeeUploadModal">가져오기</button></div></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">근무 스케줄</span><span class="excel-row-detail">현재 스케줄을 엑셀로 다운로드</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/workSchedule/excel/export">내보내기</a></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">유니폼 발주 통계</span><span class="excel-row-detail">수량 통계를 엑셀로 다운로드</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/uniform/excel-qty">내보내기</a></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">활동 로그</span><span class="excel-row-detail">시스템 활동 기록을 엑셀로 다운로드</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/auth/logs/excel">내보내기</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tab-pane fade" id="reports" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="reports-tab">
        <div class="excel-panel">
          <div class="excel-panel-head"><h2>보고서 다운로드</h2><p>월별 보고서는 조회할 월을 선택하세요.</p></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">인사 현황</span><span class="excel-row-detail">직원 현황 보고서</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/admin/hr-report/excel">다운로드</a></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">월별 근태</span><span class="excel-row-detail">선택한 월의 근태 보고서</span></div><button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-monthly-url="/attendance/report/excel">다운로드</button></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">근무 통계</span><span class="excel-row-detail">선택한 월의 근무 통계</span></div><button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-monthly-url="/workSchedule/stats/excel">다운로드</button></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">월별 요약</span><span class="excel-row-detail">인사 및 근무 현황 요약</span></div><button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-monthly-url="/admin/monthly-report/excel">다운로드</button></div>
          <div class="excel-row"><div><span class="excel-row-title">활동 로그 통계</span><span class="excel-row-detail">선택한 월의 활동 로그</span></div><button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" type="button" data-monthly-url="/auth/logs/report/excel">다운로드</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="excel-month mt-3"><label for="reportMonth" class="form-label mb-0 small">조회 월</label><input class="form-control form-control-sm" type="month" id="reportMonth" required></div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div class="modal fade" id="securityTemplateModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="securityTemplateTitle" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog"><div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header"><h2 class="modal-title fs-5" id="securityTemplateTitle">보안업무 양식 등록</h2><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="닫기"></button></div>
      <form id="securityTemplateForm" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <div class="modal-body">
          <div id="securityTemplateFields">
            <div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="securityTemplateName">양식명</label><input class="form-control" id="securityTemplateName" name="templateName" required maxlength="100"></div>
            <div class="row g-2 mb-3"><div class="col-6"><label class="form-label" for="securityTemplateDepartment">적용 부서</label><select class="form-select" id="securityTemplateDepartment" name="department"><option value="전체">전체</option><option value="보안1팀">보안1팀</option><option value="보안2팀">보안2팀</option><option value="보안3팀">보안3팀</option></select></div><div class="col-6"><label class="form-label" for="securityTemplateType">양식 유형</label><select class="form-select" id="securityTemplateType" name="templateType"><option value="daily">일일 근무</option><option value="weekly">주간 근무</option><option value="monthly">월간 근무</option><option value="special">특별 업무</option></select><select class="form-select d-none" id="securityReportType" name="reportType" disabled><option value="daily">일일</option><option value="weekly">주간</option><option value="monthly">월간</option><option value="quarterly">분기</option><option value="annual">연간</option><option value="incident">사고</option><option value="security">보안</option><option value="maintenance">점검</option></select></div></div>
            <div class="form-check mb-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="securityTemplateDefault" name="isDefault"><label class="form-check-label" for="securityTemplateDefault">이 부서·유형의 기본 양식</label></div>
          </div>
          <label class="form-label" for="securityTemplateFile">엑셀 파일 (.xlsx)</label><input class="form-control" id="securityTemplateFile" type="file" name="templateFile" accept=".xlsx" required>
          <div class="small text-muted mt-2" id="securityTemplateSize">최대 10MB</div>
          <div class="small mt-3" id="securityTemplateResult" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">취소</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="securityTemplateSubmit" type="submit">저장</button></div>
      </form>
    </div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="modal fade" id="employeeUploadModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="employeeUploadTitle" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog"><div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header"><h2 class="modal-title fs-5" id="employeeUploadTitle">직원정보 가져오기</h2><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="닫기"></button></div>
      <form id="employeeUploadForm" action="/employees/upload" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <div class="modal-body">
          <p class="small text-muted">직원정보 입력 양식에 맞춘 .xlsx 또는 .csv 파일을 선택하세요.</p>
          <label for="employeeExcelFile" class="form-label">파일 선택</label><input class="form-control" type="file" id="employeeExcelFile" name="excelFile" accept=".xlsx,.csv" required>
          <div class="form-check mt-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="skipHeader" name="skipHeader" checked><label class="form-check-label" for="skipHeader">첫 번째 행은 제목 행</label></div>
          <div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="updateExisting" name="updateExisting"><label class="form-check-label" for="updateExisting">같은 이메일의 직원정보 업데이트</label></div>
          <div id="uploadResult" class="small mt-3" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">취소</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="uploadSubmit" type="submit">가져오기</button></div>
      </form>
    </div></div>
  </div>

  <%- include('footer') %>
  <script>
    (function () {
      const month = document.getElementById('reportMonth');
      month.value = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 7);
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-monthly-url]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (!month.value) { month.focus(); return; }
        window.location.assign(button.dataset.monthlyUrl + '?month=' + encodeURIComponent(month.value));
      }));
      const form = document.getElementById('employeeUploadForm');
      const result = document.getElementById('uploadResult');
      const submit = document.getElementById('uploadSubmit');
      form.addEventListener('submit', async function (event) {
        event.preventDefault();
        const file = document.getElementById('employeeExcelFile').files[0];
        if (!file || !/\.(xlsx|csv)$/i.test(file.name) || file.size > 10 * 1024 * 1024) {
          result.textContent = '10MB 이하의 .xlsx 또는 .csv 파일을 선택하세요.';
          result.className = 'small mt-3 text-danger';
          return;
        }
        submit.disabled = true;
        result.textContent = '파일을 처리하고 있습니다.';
        result.className = 'small mt-3 text-muted';
        try {
          const response = await fetch(form.action, { method: 'POST', body: new FormData(form) });
          const data = await response.json();
          if (!response.ok || !data.success) throw new Error(data.error || data.message || (data.details || []).join(' / ') || '업로드에 실패했습니다.');
          result.textContent = data.message || '가져오기가 완료되었습니다.';
          result.className = 'small mt-3 text-success';
          form.reset();
        } catch (error) {
          result.textContent = error.message;
          result.className = 'small mt-3 text-danger';
        } finally { submit.disabled = false; }
      });
    })();
  </script>
  <script>
    (function () {
      const form = document.getElementById('securityTemplateForm');
      const modal = document.getElementById('securityTemplateModal');
      const fileInput = document.getElementById('securityTemplateFile');
      const fields = document.getElementById('securityTemplateFields');
      const type = document.getElementById('securityTemplateType');
      const reportType = document.getElementById('securityReportType');
      const result = document.getElementById('securityTemplateResult');
      const submit = document.getElementById('securityTemplateSubmit');
      let kind = 'work-order';

      if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('tab') === 'security') {
        bootstrap.Tab.getOrCreateInstance(document.getElementById('security-tab')).show();
      }

      modal.addEventListener('show.bs.modal', event => {
        form.reset();
        result.textContent = '';
        kind = event.relatedTarget.dataset.templateKind;
        const workOrder = kind === 'work-order';
        fields.hidden = workOrder;
        fields.querySelectorAll('input, select').forEach(input => { input.disabled = workOrder; });
        document.getElementById('securityTemplateName').required = !workOrder;
        type.disabled = workOrder || kind === 'summary';
        type.classList.toggle('d-none', kind === 'summary');
        reportType.disabled = workOrder || kind !== 'summary';
        reportType.classList.toggle('d-none', kind !== 'summary');
        fileInput.name = workOrder ? 'template' : 'templateFile';
        document.getElementById('securityTemplateSize').textContent = workOrder ? '최대 2MB' : '최대 10MB';
        document.getElementById('securityTemplateTitle').textContent = workOrder ? '근무명령서 엑셀 양식 교체' : kind === 'summary' ? '요약보고서 엑셀 양식 등록' : '보안업무 엑셀 양식 등록';
      });

      function renderTemplates(targetId, templates, summary) {
        const target = document.getElementById(targetId);
        target.replaceChildren();
        const excel = templates.filter(item => /\.xlsx$/i.test(item.originalName || '') && (summary ? String(item.templateType).startsWith('summary_') : !String(item.templateType).startsWith('summary_')));
        if (!excel.length) {
          const empty = document.createElement('div');
          empty.className = 'excel-row text-muted small';
          empty.textContent = '등록된 엑셀 양식이 없습니다.';
          target.appendChild(empty);
          return;
        }
        excel.forEach(item => {
          const row = document.createElement('div'); row.className = 'excel-row';
          const detail = document.createElement('div');
          const title = document.createElement('span'); title.className = 'excel-row-title'; title.textContent = item.templateName + (item.isDefault ? ' · 기본 양식' : '');
          const sub = document.createElement('span'); sub.className = 'excel-row-detail';
          sub.textContent = [item.department, item.originalName, item.createdAt ? new Date(item.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('ko-KR') : ''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');
          detail.append(title, sub);
          const link = document.createElement('a'); link.className = 'btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm'; link.textContent = '다운로드';
          link.href = '/security/api/' + (summary ? 'summary-templates' : 'templates') + '/' + encodeURIComponent(item._id) + '/download';
          row.append(detail, link); target.appendChild(row);
        });
      }

      async function loadSecurityTemplates() {
        try {
          const [infoResponse, generalResponse, summaryResponse] = await Promise.all([
            fetch('/work-orders/template/info'), fetch('/security/api/templates'), fetch('/security/api/summary-templates')
          ]);
          if (!infoResponse.ok || !generalResponse.ok || !summaryResponse.ok) throw new Error('양식 목록을 불러오지 못했습니다.');
          const [info, general, summary] = await Promise.all([infoResponse.json(), generalResponse.json(), summaryResponse.json()]);
          const name = document.getElementById('workOrderTemplateName');
          const date = document.getElementById('workOrderTemplateDate');
          if (info.template) {
            name.textContent = info.template.originalName;
            date.textContent = new Date(info.template.uploadedAt).toLocaleDateString('ko-KR') + ' 등록';
            document.getElementById('workOrderTemplateDownload').classList.remove('d-none');
          } else { name.textContent = '등록된 양식이 없습니다.'; date.textContent = ''; }
          renderTemplates('securityGeneralTemplates', general.templates || [], false);
          renderTemplates('securitySummaryTemplates', summary.templates || [], true);
        } catch (error) {
          ['workOrderTemplateName', 'securityGeneralTemplates', 'securitySummaryTemplates'].forEach(id => {
            document.getElementById(id).textContent = '양식 정보를 불러오지 못했습니다. 화면을 새로고침해 주세요.';
          });
        }
      }

      form.addEventListener('submit', async event => {
        const file = fileInput.files[0];
        const maxSize = kind === 'work-order' ? 2 : 10;
        if (!file || !/\.xlsx$/i.test(file.name) || file.size > maxSize * 1024 * 1024) {
          event.preventDefault();
          result.textContent = maxSize + 'MB 이하의 .xlsx 파일을 선택하세요.';
          result.className = 'small mt-3 text-danger';
          return;
        }
        if (kind === 'work-order') {
          form.action = '/work-orders/template';
          form.method = 'post';
          return;
        }
        event.preventDefault();
        submit.disabled = true;
        result.textContent = '파일을 저장하고 있습니다.';
        result.className = 'small mt-3 text-muted';
        try {
          const url = kind === 'summary' ? '/security/summary-reports/templates/upload' : '/security/templates/upload';
          const response = await fetch(url, { method: 'POST', body: new FormData(form) });
          const data = await response.json();
          if (!response.ok || !data.success) throw new Error(data.message || '양식 등록에 실패했습니다.');
          bootstrap.Modal.getInstance(modal).hide();
          await loadSecurityTemplates();
        } catch (error) {
          result.textContent = error.message;
          result.className = 'small mt-3 text-danger';
        } finally { submit.disabled = false; }
      });

      loadSecurityTemplates();
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
